      "content": "Sometimes I feel like I'm running in circles. Just as soon as the kitchen is clean and the dishes are put away, it’s already time to start thinking about the next meal. Does the work ever truly end?",
      "person_id": "p_012",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%202.pdf"
