      "isoDate": "1977-01-11T19:30:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 11, 1977 • 7:30 PM",
      "content": "I spent all afternoon in the kitchen today, but after thirty minutes at the dinner table, there’s nothing left to show for it but dirty plates. It’s hard not to feel a bit discouraged by the temporary nature of all our labor.",
      "person_id": "p_012",
