      "isoDate": "1977-01-11T20:45:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 11, 1977 • 8:45 PM",
      "content": "I just finished scrubbing the linoleum on my hands and knees, and not ten minutes later, someone’s already tracked dirt right across the middle. It feels like the world is constantly trying to undo my progress.",
      "person_id": "p_012",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%202.pdf"
