      "isoDate": "1977-01-11T21:15:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 11, 1977 • 9:15 PM",
      "content": "We blunder and make mistakes, and sometimes poor health is our lot for a season. Often we throw up our hands in despair and cry out, 'What's the use?'",
      "person_id": "p_012",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%202.pdf"
